  "question": {
    "text": "For a complex number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>, let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced></math> denote the real part of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all complex numbers <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> satisfying <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>. Then the minimum possible value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></math>&nbsp;with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>Re</mo><mfenced><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> is _______"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are of opposite sign, similarly&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;&amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are of opposite sign</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&#183;</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&#183;</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&#183;</mo><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>8</mn></math>.</p>"
